wikipedia entry for geometric mean provides more context than the textbook in mathematics  the geometric mean is a mean or average  which indicates the central tendency or typical value of a set of numbers by using the product of their values  as opposed to the arithmetic mean which uses their sum   the geometric mean is defined as the nth root of the product of n numbers  i e   for a set of numbers x1  x2       xn  the geometric mean is defined as      displaystyle  left  prod _ i 1   n x_ i  right    frac  1  n     sqrt  n   x_ 1 x_ 2  cdots x_ n      or  equivalently  as the arithmetic mean in logscale       displaystyle  exp   left    frac  1  n   sum  limits _ i 1   n  ln a_ i   right   
