what is mean reciprocal rank   mean reciprocal rank is a measure to evaluate systems that return a ranked list of answers to queries 
understanding tokenization tokenization refers to a process by which a piece of sensitive data  such as a credit card number  is replaced by a surrogate value known as a token  the sensitive data still generally needs to be stored securely at one centralized location for subsequent reference and requires strong protections around it 
