overview of normalization in nlp when we normalize text  we attempt to reduce its randomness  bringing it closer to a predefined  standard   this helps us to reduce the amount of different information that the computer has to deal with  and therefore improves efficiency  the goal of normalization techniques like stemming and lemmatization is to reduce inflectional forms and sometimes derivationally related forms of a word to a common base form 
