vector space model the vector space model  vsm  is based on the notion of similarity  the model assumes that the relevance of a document to query is roughly equal to the document query similarity  both the documents and queries are represented using the bag of words model  for a document collection  we first determine a set of terms  i e   vocabulary  and order the terms  next  documents are represented as n dimensional vectors  where each dimension corresponds to a term  terms are weighted using tf idf or bm25 methods  queries are also represented as n dimensional vectors     
cosine similarity in order to compute the similarity between two vectors   a  b  document query but also document document   the cosine similarity is used       
