this link explains lemmatization and provides ways of implementing in python using libraries in simpler terms  it is the process of converting a word to its base form  the difference between stemming and lemmatization is  lemmatization considers the context and converts the word to its meaningful base form  whereas stemming just removes the last few characters  often leading to incorrect meanings and spelling errors     for example  lemmatization would correctly identify the base form of  caring  to  care   whereas stemming would cutoff the  ing  part and convert it into a car 
