algolia  algolia offers a saas search api for developers who look for a turnkey solution to deliver real time  typo tolerant and location aware search in their applications and websites  in a matter of minutes  algolia brings relevancy at the first keystroke  dramatically speeding up content discovery and transforming the overall user experience  algolia runs more than 4m queries per day  mostly in usa and europe  it was founded in october of 2012 by search experts and is currently headquartered in paris  france  
this paper explores automatically generating refinements and related terms by querying for hypertext document collections when searching large hypertext document collections  it is often possible that there are too many results available for ambiguous queries  query refinement is an interactive process of query modification that can be used to narrow down the scope of search results  we propose a new method for automatically generating refinements or related terms to queries by mining anchor text for a large hypertext document collection  we show that the usage of anchor text as a basis for query refinement produces high quality refinement suggestions that are significantly better in terms of perceived usefulness compared to refinements that are derived using the document content  furthermore  our study suggests that anchor text refinements can also be used to augment traditional query refinement algorithms based on query logs  since they typically differ in coverage and produce different refinements  our results are based on experiments on an anchor text collection of a large corporate intranet 
