map vs gmap whereas gmap tends to be affected more by low values   play video starting at  3 30 and follow transcript3 30  and those are the queries that don t have good performance  the average precision is low   play video starting at  3 37 and follow transcript3 37  so if you think about the  improving the search engine for those difficult queries  then gmap would be preferred  right   play video starting at  3 47 and follow transcript3 47  on the other hand  if you just want to  have improved a lot   play video starting at  3 52 and follow transcript3 52  over all the kinds of queries or particular popular queries that might be easy and you want to make the perfect and maybe map would be then preferred  so again  the answer depends on your users  your users tasks and their pref  their preferences 
