data preparation for data mining data preparation is a fundamental stage of data analysis  while a lot of low quality information is available in various data sources and on the web  many organizations or companies are interested in how to transform the data into cleaned forms which can be used for high profit purposes  this goal generates an urgent need for data analysis aimed at cleaning the raw data  in this paper  we first show the importance of data preparation in data analysis  then introduce some research achievements in the area of data preparation  finally  we suggest some future directions of research and development 
