why f1 score is best as per my understanding  the f1 score is the harmonic mean of the precision and recall where it gives equal weightage to precision and recall  the more generic f beta score applies additional weights  valuing one of precision or recall more than the other  usecases where recall is twice as important as precision the f2 score will be more appropriate  example of higher recall usecase  as given in practice quiz    automatic system to filter tweets of the possible communication between terrorists 
