it explains the concept of tf idf and how tf and idf are inversely related  it also discusses improved approaches to the tf idf concept  the tf value is proportional to the frequency of the word in the document and the 1df value is inversely proportional to its frequency in the document corpus  the function encodes the intuitions that   1  the more often a word occurs in a document  the more it is representative of the content of the text   2  the more text the word occurs in  the less discriminating it is  fabrizio  2002  
