how to design query query expansion the power of relevance feedback comes not so much from reweighting the original query terms  as from expanding the query by adding new search terms to it  essentially  terms may be taken from the documents assessed as relevant  however  some selection should be performed  it is not usually desirable to include all such terms   different combinations of user and system effort may be used to select new terms  a simple  effective  entirely automatic procedure is as follows  all terms taken from relevant documents are ranked according to their offer weight  see robertson 1990  
