n gram model n gram model edit   the bag of words model is an orderless document representation   only the counts of words matter  for instance  in the above example  john likes to watch movies  mary likes movies too   the bag of words representation will not reveal that the verb  likes  always follows a person s name in this text  as an alternative  the n gram model can store this spatial information  applying to the same example above  a bigram model will parse the text into the following units and store the term frequency of each unit as before 
