what is mean reciprocal rank as a special case of the mean average position  we can also think about the case where there was precisely one rank in the document  and this happens often  for example  in what s called a known item search  where you know a target page  let s say you have to find amazon  homepage  you have one relevant document there  and you hope to find it  that s call a  known item search   in that case  there s precisely one relevant document  or in another application  like a question and answering  maybe there s only one answer  are there  so if you rank the answers  then your goal is to rank that one particular answer on top  right  so in this case  you can easily verify the average position  will basically boil down to reciprocal rank  that is  1 over r where r is the rank position of that single relevant document  so if that document is ranked on the very top or is 1  and then it s 1 for reciprocal rank  if it s ranked at the  the second  then it s 1 over 2  et cetera 
