map vs gmap so  do you use map or gmap   play video starting at  2 9 and follow transcript2 09  again  that s important question  imagine you are again testing a new algorithm in  by comparing the ways your old algorithms made the search engine   play video starting at  2 18 and follow transcript2 18  now you tested multiple topics  now you ve got the average precision for these topics  now you are thinking of looking at the overall performance  you have to take the average   play video starting at  2 30 and follow transcript2 30  but which  which strategy would you use   play video starting at  2 34 and follow transcript2 34  now first  you should also think about the question  well did it make a difference  can you think of scenarios where using one of them would make a difference  that is they would give different rankings of those methods  and that also means depending on the way you average or detect the  average of these average positions   play video starting at  2 55 and follow transcript2 55  you will get different conclusions  this makes the question becoming even more important   play video starting at  3 1 and follow transcript3 01  right  so  which one would you use   play video starting at  3 5 and follow transcript3 05  well again  if you look at the difference between these  different ways of aggregating the average position  you ll realize in arithmetic mean  the sum is dominating by large values  so what does large value here mean  it means the query is relatively easy  you can have a high pres  average position   play video starting at  3 25 and follow transcript3 25  whereas gmap tends to be affected more by low values   play video starting at  3 30 and follow transcript3 30  and those are the queries that don t have good performance  the average precision is low   play video starting at  3 37 and follow transcript3 37  so if you think about the  improving the search engine for those difficult queries  then gmap would be preferred  right   play video starting at  3 47 and follow transcript3 47  on the other hand  if you just want to  have improved a lot   play video starting at  3 52 and follow transcript3 52  over all the kinds of queries or particular popular queries that might be easy and you want to make the perfect and maybe map would be then preferred  so again  the answer depends on your users  your users tasks and their pref  their preferences 
