it introduces probability ranking principle definition  the probability ranking principle asserts that relevance has a probabilistic interpretation  according to this principle documents are ranked by a probability p rel d  q   where rel denotes the event of a document d being relevant to a query q  robertson called this principle the probability ranking principle
