tf transformation if you look at this document again  now it s not hard to realize that the reason why it hasn t received a high score is because it has a very high count of campaign  so the count of campaign in this document is a 4  which is much higher than the other documents  and has contributed to the high score of this document  so in treating the amount to lower the score for this document  we need to somehow restrict the contribution of the matching of this term in the document  and if you think about the matching of terms in the document carefully  you actually would realize  we probably shouldn t reward multiple occurrences so generously  and by that i mean  the first occurrence of a term says a lot about the matching of this term  because it goes from zero count to a count of one  and that increase means a lot 
