illustration to idf tf idf stands for term frequency inverse document frequency and it is a measure  used in the fields of information retrieval  ir  and machine learning  that can quantify the importance or relevance of string representations  words  phrases  lemmas  etc   in a document amongst a collection of documents  also known as a corpus  
