ding    usd 58m  funding details     investors    stony lonesome group  allectus capital  ossian capital and 1 other investors  investor details            kika keyboard      mobile application that provides emojis stickers    kika keyboard develops a mobile keyboard  the app features a collection of emojis stickers   text emoticons which can be used in social messaging apps through a keyboard  via ai   it currently supports 82 languages  the app is available for ios and android devices     company overview    founded year    2011    location    beijing  china     funding    usd 64m  funding details     investors    dalian tianshen entertainment  china prosperity capital  crcm ventures  investor details            oppscience      provider of data intelligence and analytics solutions provider    oppscience is a data intelligence and analytics solutions provider  the features of the product include information discovery and alerts  ai based documents and risk identification  semantic analysis  enterprise information retrieval  etc  the clients of the company include bnp paribas  eurovia  eutelsat  verlingue  etc     company overview    founded year    2017    location    paris  france     funding    usd 20m  funding details     investors    hsbc  aster capital  newfund and 3 other investors  investor details       
