paper about using text mining and nlp on movies series subtitles to determine emotional sentiment  in this paper  we use movies and series subtitles and applied text mining and natural language processing methods to evaluate emotions in videos  three different word lexicons were used and one of the outcomes of this research is the generation of a secondary dataset with more than 3658 records which can be used for other data analysis and data mining research  we used our secondary dataset to find and display correlations between different emotions on the videos and the correlation between emotions on the movies and users  scores on imdb using the pearson correlation method and found some statistically significant correlations 
