youtube video that talks about tf idf  bm25  sbert vector based methods vector similarity search is one of the fastest growing domains in ai and machine learning  at its core  it is the process of matching relevant pieces of information together     similarity search is a complex topic and there are countless techniques for building effective search engines     in this video  we ll cover three vector based approaches for comparing languages and identifying similar  documents   covering both vector similarity search and semantic search       tf idf    bm25    sentence bert
