google page ranking and search engine optimization purpose  the purpose of this paper is to identify the most popular techniques used to rank a web page highly in google     design methodology approach  the paper presents the results of a study into 50 highly optimized web pages that were created as part of a search engine optimization competition  the study focuses on the most popular techniques that were used to rank highest in this competition  and includes an analysis on the use of pagerank  number of pages  number of in links  domain age and the use of third party sites such as directories and social bookmarking sites  a separate study was made into 50 non optimized web pages for comparison     findings  the paper provides insight into the techniques that successful search engine optimizers use to ensure a page ranks highly in google  recognizes the importance of pagerank and links as well as directories and social bookmarking sites 
