what is embedding based retrieval the application of embeddings in retrieval is called embedding based retrieval or ebr for short  briefly  embedding based retrieval is a technique to use embeddings to represent query and documents  and then convert the retrieval problem into a nearest neighbor  nn  search problem in the embedding space 
