how to use precision recall to evaluate a ranked list we have to look after the precision recall at different  cut offs  because in the end  the approximation of relevant documents  set  given by a ranked list  is determined by where the user stops browsing  right  if we assume the user  securely browses  the list of results  the user would  stop at some point  and that point would determine the set  and then  that s the most important  cut off  that we have to consider  when we compute the precision recall  without knowing where exactly user would stop  then we have to consider  all the positions where the user could stop  
