answer to what is a bag of words model the bag of words model is a simplifying representation used in natural language processing and information retrieval  ir   in this model  a text  such as a sentence or a document  is represented as the bag  multiset  of its words  disregarding grammar and even word order but keeping multiplicity  the bag of words model has also been used for computer vision  1 
