explains drawbacks of n grams  if we use n grams  e g    stock price  as a single term   it wouldn t  automatically  match a single word like  stock  or  price   this means if a document says  price of stock   it wouldn t match the phrase  if we use both  stock price  and  price  as indexing terms  it would also cause complication in assigning weights because we might over reward matching the phrase  stock price  since it would not only match the phrase term  stock price  but also two single words  stock  and  price   
