research about types and techniques of inverted idexes there has been a s ubstantial amount of research on high performance inverted index because most web and search engines use an inverted index to execute queries  documents are normally stored as lists of words  but inverted indexes invert this by storing for each word the list of documents that the word appears in  hence the name  inverted index   this paper presents the crucial research findings on inverted indexes  their types and techniques
