explains advantage and disadvantage of bm25 okapi bm25 is a retrieval model based on the probabilistic retrieval framework  the main advantage of bm25 which makes it popular is its efficiency  it performs very well in many ad hoc retrieval tasks  especially those designed by trec  we can consider bm25 as the state of the art tf idf like retrieval model  it doesn t mean that bm25 relies on tf idf  or the vector space model  framework  by this sentence  i mean that the bm25 score is calculated based on two main components  tf and idf  however  there are some techniques for document length normalization and satisfying the concavity constraint of the term frequency  e g   considering the logarithmic tf  instead of the raw tf   based on these heuristic techniques  bm25 often achieves better performance compared to tf idf     but  there is a big disadvantage for bm25  it is full of hacks heuristics  this fact makes it hard to extend this framework  this is why the language modeling framework becomes popular  it s very well established with theoretically sound foundations and it is based on probabilistic distributions and thus very easy to extend 
