this paragraph explains the two types of pull mode   pulling involves two aspects     querying  we query the search engine through a keyword  and the engine returns relevant documents  the ability of the engine to deliver relevant content dictates whether the search engine is doing a good job or not  querying works very well when users know what they are looking for       browsing  the user navigates the structure of the documents to find the information he s looking for  as you can intuitively understand  this strategy works well when the user doesn t know what to look for or can t conveniently query the system 
