relationship between tf idf vs cosine similarity tf idf is a transformation you apply to texts to get two real valued vectors  you can then obtain the cosine similarity of any pair of vectors by taking their dot product and dividing that by the product of their norms  that yields the cosine of the angle between the vectors 
