elaborates on f measure more and with recall and precision the two primary metrics are precision and recall  given a subject and a gold standard  precision is the proportion of cases that the subject classified as positive that were positive in the gold standard  it is equivalent to positive predictive value  recall is the proportion of positive cases in the gold standard that were classified as positive by the subject  it is equivalent to sensitivity  the two metrics are often combined as their harmonic mean  known as the f measure 8 which can be formulated as follows     
