explained why to penalize long documents another problem that is skipped in tf idf is document length  if a document happens to be very short and it contains  computer  once  that might already be a good indicator of relevance  but if the document is really long and the term  computer  only appears once  it is likely that the document is not about computer  we want to give a reward to term matches to short documents and penalize the long one  however  you do not want to over penalize because sometimes a document is long because it contains lots of contains relevant information rather than just having lots of words 
